    "version": "rmcp 0.8.5 LATEST is 2025-03-26 and its client handshake does not reject arbitrary returned versions. Native initialize now requests the frozen 2025-06-18; known 2024-11-05/2025-03-26 fallbacks are retained. Unsupported versions are closed before catalog/tool use and unknown version strings are not reflected into errors.",
